MLA Standard: MLA.PC.TR.8
Question:
On the unit circle, why is the angle 0 degrees connected to sine and cosine values
{
~B. The radius represents tangent and the diameter represents cosine#This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
